      "message": "Fix what the audit found after the rehaul\n\nThree things were broken: the search palette could not be closed and\nthe claim fold never folded, because the stylesheet had no rule for\nthe hidden attribute; the copy button lost its icon after one use.\nA few pages still said things the log says: raw ids on the lessons\npage, the inbox and the activity rows, r1 and r2, drawn, session\nids, a clock where an age belongs. Every field has a name for a\nscreen reader, icons are hidden from it, secondary text and the\nchips clear the contrast bar in the light theme, number fields lose\nthe browser spinner, and the rules nothing renders any more are\ngone from the stylesheet. Two links went where the words did not say:\nthe interdiff tab and a task found by the palette. A diff cut at a\nmegabyte no longer splits a character; an activity filter that\nmatches nothing in its window still offers the next one.\n\nChange-Id: Iaudit0138\nTask: t-2ce5yee0ym31y9myc1ggrw9jte\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
